{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/65779da2a36588ede4de3fa625aba502.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1024 height=187 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mellings is a 3D shooting game where you control a fixed turret in the middle of a battlefield. Aim and adjust your shot to defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will launch expeditions, with the ability to choose more and more parameters to personalize your game and your risk/reward ratio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.poster.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.webm?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.mp4?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/b29c97aa66fbaadc301da36a342f9534.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1024 height=187 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rebuild a city for the Mellings, your subterranean people, who have been imprisoned everywhere in the world! Launch missions, at the controls of your excavator, across different regions to bring back resources and survivors to your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/90bcf8bb09fa7864875c1aa478a64498.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can target various regions, inhabited by peoples with different characteristics. Choose the map's features carefully to obtain rewards commensurate with the danger you are about to face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/97cd28aec8b1e1c58c4f660a85c5bcb3.avif?t=1771017746\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the battlefield, unleash your claws to seize the enemy's loot! While they return with precious cargo, use your various cannons to destroy your attackers and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.poster.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.webm?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.mp4?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763040?t=1771017746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/18a8a830de4fcc50bd4c9148167c3adb307a4b31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771017746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/5a49ac6cc646f20b362724649d8064750c824c3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771017746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/5a49ac6cc646f20b362724649d8064750c824c3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771017746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4211400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/65779da2a36588ede4de3fa625aba502.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1024 height=187 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mellings is a 3D shooting game where you control a fixed turret in the middle of a battlefield. Aim and adjust your shot to defend yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will launch expeditions, with the ability to choose more and more parameters to personalize your game and your risk/reward ratio.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.poster.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.webm?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.mp4?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/b29c97aa66fbaadc301da36a342f9534.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1024 height=187 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must rebuild a city for the Mellings, your subterranean people, who have been imprisoned everywhere in the world! Launch missions, at the controls of your excavator, across different regions to bring back resources and survivors to your home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/90bcf8bb09fa7864875c1aa478a64498.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can target various regions, inhabited by peoples with different characteristics. Choose the map's features carefully to obtain rewards commensurate with the danger you are about to face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/97cd28aec8b1e1c58c4f660a85c5bcb3.avif?t=1771017746\" width=612 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the battlefield, unleash your claws to seize the enemy's loot! While they return with precious cargo, use your various cannons to destroy your attackers and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.poster.avif?t=1771017746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763040/extras/1711450a55f9cb036f23db3d4cee7ccf.webm?t=1771017746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://share